WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.455
This is personal work.

00:00:01.455 --> 00:00:05.822
Fill an outreach pack so you are not inventing messages under stress.

00:00:05.822 --> 00:00:08.369
This lesson is about personal: outreach pack.

00:00:08.369 --> 00:00:09.824
Attachment: 10 message templates.

00:00:09.824 --> 00:00:12.371
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:12.371 --> 00:00:16.009
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:16.009 --> 00:00:21.467
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:25.470
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:29.472
Stay practical: fill outreach pack before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:29.792 --> 00:00:33.875
Fill ten message templates: openers, follow-ups, soft closes, and thank-yous.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.325
Remember the objective: fill outreach pack.

00:00:36.325 --> 00:00:40.817
Write the idea in your own words before you move on.

00:00:40.817 --> 00:00:45.717
Name one concrete next action you can finish in under an hour.

00:00:45.717 --> 00:00:50.208
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:55.108
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:00:55.108 --> 00:00:57.967
Talk to a real person when possible.

00:00:57.967 --> 00:00:59.600
Feedback beats guessing alone.

